"Spline predictors: hazard ratio between the third and the first quartile; "
"the p is the likelihood ratio test of the whole (non-linear) association."
msgstr "Predictores con spline: hazard ratio entre el tercer y el primer cuartil; la p es la prueba de razón de verosimilitudes de toda la asociación (no lineal)."

#: R/cplogistic.b.R
msgid ""
"Spline predictors: odds ratio between the third and the first quartile; the "
"p is the likelihood ratio test of the whole (non-linear) association."
msgstr "Predictores con spline: odds ratio entre el tercer y el primer cuartil; la p es la prueba de razón de verosimilitudes de toda la asociación (no lineal)."

#: R/cplinear.b.R
msgid ""
"Spline terms (', '') are the non-linear parts of a restricted cubic spline; "
"their coefficients have no direct interpretation (see the effects, Q3 vs Q1, "
"or SHAP)."
msgstr "Los términos de spline (', '') son las partes no lineales de un spline cúbico restringido; sus coeficientes no tienen interpretación directa (vea los efectos, Q3 frente a Q1, o SHAP)."

#: R/cpcox.b.R
msgid ""
"Spline terms (', '') are the non-linear parts of a restricted cubic spline; "
"their coefficients have no direct interpretation (see the hazard ratios, Q3 "
"vs Q1, or SHAP)."
msgstr "Los términos de spline (', '') son las partes no lineales de un spline cúbico restringido; sus coeficientes no tienen interpretación directa (vea los hazard ratios, Q3 frente a Q1, o SHAP)."

#: R/cplogistic.b.R
msgid ""
"Spline terms (', '') are the non-linear parts of a restricted cubic spline; "
"their coefficients have no direct interpretation (see the odds ratios, Q3 vs "
"Q1, or SHAP)."
msgstr "Los términos de spline (', '') son las partes no lineales de un spline cúbico restringido; sus coeficientes no tienen interpretación directa (vea los odds ratios, Q3 frente a Q1, o SHAP)."

