#: R/cppublished.b.R
msgid ""
"Terms name variables of the data: <code>age</code>, <code>sex = male</code>, "
"<code>log(crp)</code>, <code>age^2</code>, <code>age/10</code>, <code>age * "
"sex = male</code>; a row <code>Intercept</code>. For Cox models, rows "
"<code>baseline survival</code> (at the horizon), <code>horizon</code> and, "
"when the published prognostic index is centred, <code>centre</code>."
msgstr "Los términos nombran variables de los datos: <code>age</code>, <code>sex = male</code>, <code>log(crp)</code>, <code>age^2</code>, <code>age/10</code>, <code>age * sex = male</code>; una fila <code>Intercept</code>. Para modelos de Cox, filas <code>baseline survival</code> (en el horizonte), <code>horizon</code> y, cuando el índice pronóstico publicado está centrado, <code>centre</code>."

#: cpCox/results/modelFreqTable.columns.title
#: cpLinear/results/modelFreqTable.columns.title
